ip between accumulated exposure and quantitative scores in myasthenia gravis patients. <i>CPT: pharmacometrics &amp; systems pharmacology 12(7):963–976</i>. DOI:<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1002/psp4.12966\">10.1002/psp4.12966</a> PUBMED:<a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/37060188\">37060188</a></p></li></ol></body></html>", revisions = "<html><body><ul><li>11/2026 generated by pharmacolibrary-dev export.pharmacolibrary_models from Chen_2023: parameters extracted from the paper by the pharmacolibrary-dev pipeline, model built by its engineer, reviewed: curated candidate</li></ul></body></html>"),
